      "transliteration": "nirmānamohā jitasaṅgadoṣā adhyātmanityā vinivṛttakāmāḥ .\ndvandvairvimuktāḥ sukhaduḥkhasaṃjñairgacchantyamūḍhāḥ padamavyayaṃ tat ||15-5||",
