          "english": "Just as sealing an important commitment with a sincere dedication to a higher purpose ensures that minor human errors do not compromise the integrity of the work, invoking the Supreme through \"Om Tat Sat\" sanctifies our daily actions and duties, elevating them from mundane routines into meaningful offerings.",
