        "english": "God Krishna defines the rajasic agent (the doer in the mode of passion). This type of person is intensely attached to worldly pleasures, driven by a greedy hunger for material rewards, careless about harming others to achieve their goals, mentally and spiritually unclean, and emotionally unstable—riding a roller coaster of elation when succeeding and deep depression when failing.",
